{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \r\n\r\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0046177 D-gluconate catabolic process\r\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/27106\r\nThis term represents a MF.  Consider GO:0046316 gluconokinase activity [EC:2.7.1.12]\r\n\r\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \r\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1txGFvoagO-a_NGUoLTBoZm1dxEbsWwF9XA8Ew0hLjLA/edit?gid=0#gid=0\r\n\r\nImpacted groups: \r\nEcoCyc 4\r\nPomBase 2\r\n\r\n\r\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\r\n----\r\n\r\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \r\nterm\tfile\tline\r\nGO:0046177\tmetacyc2go\tMetaCyc:GLUCONSUPER-PWY > GO:D-gluconate catabolic process ; GO:0046177\r\nGO:0046177\tunirule2go\tUniRule:UR000683091 > GO:D-gluconate catabolic process ; GO:0046177\r\nGO:0046177\thamap2go\tHAMAP:MF_02094 > GO:D-gluconate catabolic process ; GO:0046177\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks.\r\n", "created_at": "2024-12-13T00:32:34Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0046177 D-gluconate catabolic process", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-01-12T16:34:10Z"}
